---
import Section from '../Section.astro';

const pains = [
	'It works on my computer, but I don’t know how to put it online.',
	'It’s live, but it’s slow, it crashes, or I’m afraid to change anything.',
	'I’m not sure my users’ data is safe.',
	'The hosting bill keeps going up and I don’t know why.',
];
---

<Section label="01 — Built with AI?">
	<h2>AI got you a working app. Production is a different job.</h2>
	<p class="body">
		AI tools make building fast. Putting what you built in front of real customers, reliably, securely and without
		surprise costs, still takes experience. That’s the part I handle, and I explain it in plain language.
	</p>
	<ul class="pains" role="list">
		{pains.map((p) => <li>“{p}”</li>)}
	</ul>
</Section>

<style>
	.pains {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}
	li {
		padding-left: 1rem;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.375rem;
		line-height: 1.35;
	}
</style>
